'''Will of the Lords''' is a [[trap]] [[spell]] granted by {{il|Hand of the Lords}}.

__TOC__

==Sources==
{{il|Hand of the Lords}} grants the level 30 version of the skill.

The [[Vestigial implicit]] mod grants the level 20 version of the skill. 

==Skill functions and interactions==
This skill throws a [[trap]] that creates a rift, summoning a giant hand that deals [[physical]] [[spell]] [[area]] damage around it. This skill also gains 25% of physical damage [[gained as]] extra fire/cold/lightning/chaos damage per red/green/blue/white [[socket]] on the [[gloves]] respectively. This skill deals 20% more damage with hits and ailments per [[curse]] on the target.

